<title>ITALY: Imi says plans to turn brokerage into bank.</title>
<headline>Imi says plans to turn brokerage into bank.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank Imi said on Thursday it plans to transform its brokerage Imi Sigeco Sim Spa into a bank, to hold all the controlling stakes in firms Imi owns abroad which operate in the sector.</p>
<p>It added that the antitrust authority will have to approve the move.</p>
<p>Imi's board said it wanted to rationalise all its Italian and foreign holdings. It gave no further details. -- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
